          "kicker": "Career regrets",
          "heading": "Former winger Chris Ashton admits he is 'still p*ssed off' about England",
          "body": "Former England winger Chris Ashton has admitted he remains deeply unsatisfied with his international career, stating he is \"still p*ssed off\" about how his time in the national shirt unfolded. Despite scoring 20 tries in 44 Test appearances and winning two Six Nations titles, the Premiership's all-time record try scorer revealed he wanted \"way more\" from his time with England. Now working as a television pundit, the 39-year-old confessed that his perceived failure to truly establish himself on the international stage still bothers him."
