          "body": "Wales head into their second WXV Global Series encounter against the USA looking to build on their impressive eight-try victory over South Africa. Head coach Sean Lynn has confirmed that Lleucu George will return to start at fly-half following the injury to Seren Lockwood, who is observing return-to-play protocols. With Carys Cox also returning to the wing, Lynn noted, \"I'm super excited to see the half-back combination that we've got this week.\" Wales are targeting their first consecutive Test wins under his tenure."
