          "body": "Les Kiss has gambled on a significant positional change for Sunday’s showdown with the world champion Springboks, naming Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii on the wing for the first time in his 25-Test career. While Suaalii has previously been deployed exclusively in the centres, the head coach is banking on his aerial prowess to counter South Africa’s kicking game. Australia will also employ a 6-2 forward-heavy bench split, with Kiss stating, “we have worked hard on key areas to meet this challenge.”"
